      },
      "content": "Remove the Air Breaker Assembly",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0900",
      "reading_order": 1017,
      "section": "Remove the Air Breaker Assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 472.32,
        "r": 289.66999999999985,
        "b": 414.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "The Air breaker assembly is mounted on the left side of the tub. Its purpose is to provide a method of supplying water for the wash and rinse cycles. The air gap prevents the siphoning of wash water from flowing back into the water supply system and prevents the water pressure from not dropping below atmospheric pressure."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "txt_0901",
      "reading_order": 1018,
      "section": "Remove the Air Breaker Assembly",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 409.32,
        "r": 263.6899999999999,
        "b": 391.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "The Air breaker assembly also allows air into the tub for improved drying."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0902",
      "reading_order": 1019,
      "section": "To remove the air breaker assembly:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 36.0,
        "t": 386.32,
        "r": 186.52000000000004,
        "b": 378.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "To remove the air breaker assembly:",
      "level": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0903",
      "reading_order": 1020,
      "section": "To remove the air breaker assembly:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.0,
        "t": 373.32,
        "r": 218.54999999999998,
        "b": 365.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Unplug dishwasher or disconnect power."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0904",
      "reading_order": 1021,
      "section": "To remove the air breaker assembly:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.0,
        "t": 360.32,
        "r": 169.89999999999998,
        "b": 352.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Remove the base side panel."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0905",
      "reading_order": 1022,
      "section": "To remove the air breaker assembly:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 42.0,
        "t": 347.32,
        "r": 265.63999999999993,
        "b": 329.7121008403361
      },
      "content": "Disconnect flow meter harness from the air breaker assembly (see Figure 1)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0906",
      "reading_order": 1023,
      "section": "To remove the air breaker assembly:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 706.6469000000001,
        "r": 554.7300000000001,
        "b": 689.0390008403361
      },
      "content": "Open the door and from inside the cabinet, rotate the air breaker nut and remove it from the air breaker assembly."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0907",
      "reading_order": 1024,
      "section": "To remove the air breaker assembly:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 309.0,
        "t": 683.6469000000001,
        "r": 559.9959,
        "b": 666.0390008403361
      },
      "content": "Pull away the air breaker assembly and remove the four (4) clamps securing the hoses to the assembly. See Figure 2."
    },
